# unit_view_gauges: unit tests (call) from the start of a Novice race: the
# view taken from a record with flag bit 13, every stage of the Super FX
# picture upload, and the second speed gauge's cases (no values, a negative
# speed, the cap, a high-gear negative speed, steps down into range).
